      "cooked": "<p>I currently own everything for SotM and essentially leave it with&nbsp;a club at college&nbsp;I frequent to be used there.&nbsp; But with graduation lurking in the \"near\" future my copy would be going home with me.&nbsp; The people who run the club were looking to buy a new copy and were wondering if a complete set would ever be sold.&nbsp; Not the \"Everything in the Multiverse\" collection because they don't want to tie up club funds in a Kickstarter, but some sort of bundle&nbsp;on the store they could just buy all at once and it'd be everything.</p>",
